  "finding": "Old hidden-window Win32 route returned false and produced no target _NET_ACTIVE_WINDOW request. Initial old-route requests used source 2, timestamp 0, requestor 0. The native click timestamp was not reaching KWin. Native application-source requests with the real timestamp/requestor and session-owned target succeeded. This locates the failed handoff; it does not claim knowledge of every KWin policy branch.",
  "repair": "One original EWMH application activation from the native UI thread; owned Wine X11 property supplies target XID. Verify active and keyboard target (including child ancestry), then independent Windows foreground/keyboard result. Count only confirmed success. No HWND cast/title lookup, global focus setting or topmost workaround.",
